  "instructions": [
    "Heat the score-fat in the cataplana vessel over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the chicken to the vessel and cook until browned, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the grated ginger and minced garlic to the vessel and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the soy sauce, shaoxing wine, and canned tomatoes to the vessel, stirring to combine.",
    "Bring the mixture to a boil, then reduce the heat to medium-low and simmer for 10 minutes.",
    "Stir in the chopped scallions and roasted peanuts.",
    "Season the mixture with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "Serve the Unique Umami Chinese Chicken Kung Pao hot, garnished with additional scallions and peanuts if desired."
